  <!-- RM_LargeSlimyTree: port of AB_LargeSlimyTree (Alpha Biomes 1.6/Defs/ThingDefs_Plants/Plants_GelatinousSuperorganism.xml), plain XML copy 2026-10-18 for donor retirement.
